---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact — The Daily AI Pulse"
  description="Send a correction, project question, or security report."
>
  <article class="information-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">CONTACT</p>
    <h1>Send a note.</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      The publication uses its public GitHub repository for corrections, questions, and project
      feedback.
    </p>
    <section>
      <h2>Corrections and feedback</h2>
      <p>
        <a href="https://github.com/GadDev/daily-ai-pulse/issues/new/choose">Open an issue</a> and
        include the story link, the point to correct, and a supporting source. A GitHub account is
        required to file an issue.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Security or private concerns</h2>
      <p>
        Do not post a security vulnerability in a public issue. Follow the repository’s{' '}
        <a href="https://github.com/GadDev/daily-ai-pulse/blob/main/SECURITY.md">
          security reporting instructions
        </a>
        .
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
